        "created_at": "2014-02-06T04:38:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Of course, you COULD just ignore the fact that their names are the same and have each of their cards that say Legacy only apply to them, and have limited cards be on a one-per-player basis. It's not technically how the rules should have it, but technically the rule is \"don't do it,\" so whatever, and this is less complex.</p>",
