        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/nielzabub/{size}/1986_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-06T04:51:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>In the game we played, the limited cards weren't a problem. Finest Legacy was the only one who played Inspiring Presence, Young Legacy was the only one who played Surge of Strength, and Greatest Legacy was the only one who played Fortitude, which is ironic when you think about it.</p>",
