        "created_at": "2014-02-06T10:58:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think Blade totally underestimated Platform Bot, thinking maybe it was a toy or something. He looks a little bemused but unconcerned, and he's certainly not rushing to do anything about it.&nbsp;</p><p>I wouldn't be surprised if the next frame involved Blade clutching his sliced-open and cauterised face.&nbsp;</p>",
