      {
        "id": 89082,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-06T20:51:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Shave-bot!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I like the rules that limited apply to all of them, so you can't stack fortitude or inspiring, but each card only applies to the Legacy whose play area the card is in. &nbsp;It causes them to specialize, and is more balanced. (three insp. presence and a galvanize is too much)</p>",
